**Theorem 107.1 (attained missing-rank repair at the actual endpoint).**
For $d<k$ choose, from $R$ alone, an ordered set $J\subseteq\{1,\ldots,k\}$
of $k-d$ coordinate rows completing its row space to $\mathbb Q^k$.
Actually execute Tick;Hold once, then Read the $p_iR$ terminals for
