$$
(\mathrm{Read},\mathrm{Add},\mathrm{Tick},\mathrm{Hold},P,S)
=(k-d,0,1,1,0,0),\qquad w=BH\theta.
\tag{107.1}
$$

Together with the genuinely retained $R\theta$, either returned vector
